            "review_text": "Jonny172147\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam35 contributions\n0\nVery tasty Vietnamese food\nAug 2019\nThe food here was very enjoyable so we went there twice in a short stay in Da Nang. We really enjoyed the pork with bamboo and the pork with pickles. The okra was also really good with the tofu dipping sauce. The staff were really friendly and they were lovely with our baby daughter too.\nWritten August 13, 2019",
