            "review_title": "Review at Bep Thin - Thin Kitchen",
            "review_text": "Helen S\n10 contributions\n0\nAuthentic Vietnamese\nAug 2019 • Couples\nWent here tonight and got some great authentic Vietnamese food. Staff were lovely and despite my inabilty to speak Vietnamese we were able to order a great meal. Restaurant is clean, nicely furnished and cool. Prices very reasonable. If you are in Danang give this place a try for a genuine Vietnamese cuisine experience.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 7, 2019",
